    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8aaea0b380b336196ed2c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量出色地完成了『高松宫纪念』。\n对于这场比赛，观众们都惊叹不已，\n对后冠赛马娘的评价也有了改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc1c27b868ccab34f332e6a54477a8cfc391bc044f3cbb42f55903fe09e908df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109435.json",
