    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a5f9473a87a6992daf71d73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这万众瞩目的时刻，\n莱茵力量表示将参加『维多利亚英里赛』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbabdda76c33bdc2bf799a9656679e21a3bf00c625cdb014c432618c3361b66d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109435.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2593263fa0e9a02fb74c5213",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到这个消息的东商变革表现得很不满。\n因受伤而无法出赛的她，\n要求让人去赢过莱茵力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70029a809de35d636087dfc8f9aeedf042a9d582e72f60c8b7bd20f2a520c92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109435.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb55f3585880fc6b8d819d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今为止，我们都作为后冠赛马娘闪耀着光辉。\n然而，现在却要把后冠路线的未来\n托付给莱茵力量，这样太奇怪了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c644b3c64179b7138ae52f93d62c7a874b6303bb1799c7b25627d0c7fa508060",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109435.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
