      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而某一天，她在吃饭时不知不觉睡着了。\n还做了未来的西沙里奥的梦。\n最近这样的情况经常出现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66ccce7be156abffc89c2d17a1ffd951a072456b4f553bff8966828967ce7bdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
