    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79f4f7525ac1fc70f21d8ddf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这位马娘说自己是莱茵力量的粉丝。\n还说想让长大后的孩子\n看看莱茵的赛跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d1e3be7b6705397e00174a3aa83fb88cd21aee8b822fa0e7567f7bb1c27bc8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
