      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要让这个孩子变得憧憬自己。\n莱茵力量发誓要在『短途马锦标』上\n竭尽全力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03410e3caa757a3ee20110323469e59b42e5e0edd3b504bb0ab1c87fdaa5b6f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
