    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860b32b75da8972438a1e95f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，她也不会就此止步。\n“就由我来延伸出新的路线”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef28f51be3b105ae491a8debfd325cdb229c3ce955584b9b703387a6f51b8060",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109437.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:768e5be842d8d2006729ec10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要和后冠赛马娘相互竞争。\n如此下定决心后，她将下一个目标\n定为了『伊丽莎白女王杯』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1accf56c6da2f06fd3855ba3e4f19e18e1336749a99bf93a66e7c4f131b78b4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
